    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mihayo kwītwa kūbiza mipya hangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yelemia aho ataalī alugalīlilwe mu jeela ya ng'wibīndo lya balang'hani, ū mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA gūkang'wizīīla lūkangala lo kabīlī; gūlīhaya: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū SEEBA ū nseemi wa sī, ūyo wībeeja hūna wīyīta yīmīīle īdaame, ī lina lyakwe ng'wene SEEBA; alilūūlū, ū SEEBA ng'wenūyo alīhaya gīkī, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Nitanage nene nakūkwidīka, hama nakūkūlanja mihayo mitaale īkīlile witegelegea, īyo ūtīmanile ū bebe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA, ū Mulungu wa Isilaeli alījihaya ī numba ja mu nzengo gwenūyū, nī numba j'ikūlū lya mu Yuda, ījo jikūkambagūlagwa gīkī gabeejiwe mahangīgījo ga būdumīlwa kūlwa būlūgū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ū ng'wikanza lya kwilwisha na Bakalidayo; alīhaya gīkī, ‘Jikookala mibimba ya banhū abo nakūbabūlaga kūlwa būpelanu wane. Nakwibisa, ū nzengo gwenūyū gūtizūbūbona ū būshū bone, kūlwa nguno ya būbi waago.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Alīyo nahene nakūgwenhela dūhū ī mhola na būpīji; a banhū bane nakūbapīja, nabinhe mhola na būlembeezu būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū ba Yuda na Isilaeli nakūbashosha ū kūfuma mu būding'wa wabo; hama ī sī jabo nakūjizenga hangī jibize gīt'ūmo jalī ī kwandya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakūbeeja pyī ī shibi shabo īsho baanīītīla, na nakūbalekeja pyī ī shibi shabo īsho bashīta kūlwa kūnigomela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū nzengo gwenūyū gūkwenha lūkumo lwawiza ū kūlī nene, hamò na būyegi, na kūkumīlījiwa, n'ikūjo hose pyī ū mu mahanga ga mu sī ayo gakwīyigwa pyī ī yose ī yawiza, īyo nakūgwītīla. A mahanga gakogoha na kūdetema kūlwa wingī bo na mhola, īsho nakūgwinha ū nzengo gwenūyū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Ī lipandī lyenīlī mukūlīhayaga gīkī, ‘Ī lyenīlī itogolo dūhū lītī na shose shose; ndūhū mo banhū, nūūlū ndimu jitīmo.’ Alīyo ū mu mizengo ya Yuda nū mu mapanda ga mu Yelusalemu ayo gapeelwa, ūmo batīmo banhū nūūlū ndimu; gakūyiwigwiwa mo malaka; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "malaka ga būyegi, na kūsangabala, malaka ga batoolwa na ga batooji, na malaka ga benhi ba shakwinha sha kūlūmba mu numba ya ng'wa SEEBA; abo bakūyūyomba:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ī sī yenīyī nakwīshokeja ū wiza wayo ūbo yalī nabo kwīngīīla kale na kale,” alīhaya SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wa mabità alīhaya gīkī, “Ū ng'wipandī lyenīlī īlo līl'itogolo dūhū, lītī na shose shose; ndūhū mo banhū, nūūlū ndimu jitīmo; hose pyī ū mu mizengo yalyo gakūbiza mo madīīmīlo hangī, na badīīmi kūtūūgīja mo madaale ga ng'holo jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu mizengo ya kū sī ja magūlya ga mitulumenho ya ngūlū ja ng'weli, nī Negevu; nū mu sī ya Benjamini, nū mu magūngūli ga hihī hihī na Yelusalemu, nū mu mizengo ya Būyudaya, gakūbiza mo madaale ga ng'holo hangī, jikūyūbīta kū būtongi wa banhū bakūjibalaga,” alīhaya SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, “Shīkū jikwiza nakūshikīlīje ū kwisagīja kwane ūko naabisagīja banhū ba numba ya Isilaeli na ba numba ya Yuda, kūlwa shigongo shane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū SEEBA alīhaya, “Ū Daūdi atūgayiwa munhū wa kwigasha h'isumbī lya būtemi lya numba ya Isilaeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a bagabīji ba lūganda lwa Lawī batalagayiwa munhū wa kwīmīīla kū būtongi wane kūnifunīja shitambò sha kūpemvwa na kūzuukīja shakwinha sha būsu, na kūfunya shitambò sha būlī lūshikū.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.33.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
